<PARAM arraysize="69x11" datatype="char" name="HISTORY" value="Derived from the fixed 1378-row S82XL host catalog.                  Observed HSC host magnitudes were corrected as mag_mode-a_band.      Rest SDSS u/g/r proxies use HSC g/r/i, g/r/z, r/i/y by bin.          Science bins: (0.1,0.25), [0.25,0.5), [0.5,0.7).                     Mass: RC15 BC03 g-r/r MLCR; slope=1.629 intercept=-0.792.            Cosmology: flat LCDM H0=70 km/s/Mpc, Om0=0.3.                        Solar SDSS-r absolute magnitude: 4.65.                               Lx/Mstar uses linear S82XL LFull without absorption correction.      Morphology uses GaMPEN B/T mode at approximate rest 450 nm.          NaN means outside scope or a required band failed quality checks.    Central proxy estimates only; no uncertainty propagation or clipping.">
<DESCRIPTION>FITS HISTORY card values</DESCRIPTION>
</PARAM>
